---
/** smolpng's window. Placeholder voice and branding until its own window is authored. */
---

<section class="frame lift" data-placeholder="project-window" style="padding-top:clamp(56px,8vh,90px)" aria-labelledby="smol-h">
  <div class="smol">
    <div class="smol-win" data-reveal="fade">
      <h2 id="smol-h" class="smol-h">Make images smol.</h2>
      <p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;max-width:36ch">smolpng: local-first image compression for people, scripts, and agents.</p>
      <span class="btn btn-solid btn-off" style="margin-top:24px" aria-disabled="true" title="smolpng doesn’t have a public home yet">Explore smolpng →</span>
    </div>
    <div class="squish" role="img" aria-label="Placeholder for the commissioned Squishling artwork">Squishling, hugging an oversized image inward. Commissioned art pending; artist credited here.</div>
  </div>
</section>